# GrokForge — copy to `.env` in the project root (never commit real keys).
# Loaded in the Electron **main** process only (`import 'dotenv/config'` in `src/main/main.ts`).
#
# Coding agents (Grok Build, Claude Code) sign in through their own CLIs (`grok login`,
# `claude` → /login); they need nothing here.

# xAI API key, used only for Grok Voice and read-aloud. See https://docs.x.ai/
XAI_API_KEY=

# Optional alias if you prefer a GrokForge-specific name:
# GROKFORGE_XAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: Grok Voice Agent WebSocket base URL (default wss://api.x.ai/v1/realtime).
# GROKFORGE_XAI_REALTIME_URL=

# Optional: xAI TTS URL for read-aloud (default https://api.x.ai/v1/tts).
# GROKFORGE_XAI_TTS_URL=

# Optional: point GrokForge at a specific agent binary when it isn't on PATH.
# GROKFORGE_GROK_PATH=/path/to/grok
# GROKFORGE_CLAUDE_PATH=/path/to/claude
